questions.explanation:
The logic followed here is:

Logic: The second number is the first number minus 1, then cube.

Here,

10 → (10 &minus; 1)&sup3;

= 9&sup3;

= 729 

Similarly,

7 → (7 &minus; 1)&sup3;

= 6&sup3;

= 216 

Hence, the correct answer is **"Option 1."**

